## MCServerJars deployment

### Frontend (Vercel)

- Project root: `mcserverjars.com/`
- Configure env vars (Supabase + optional service role) from `secrets.json`.

### Backend API (VPS / Docker)

Project root: `mcserverjars.com/backend/`

The backend expects at minimum:

- `DATABASE_URL` (required)
- `SUPABASE_URL` (defaults exist)
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` or `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- `PORT` (default 3001)

Dockerfile exists for production builds. Typical flow:

```bash
cd mcserverjars.com/backend
docker build -t mcserverjars-api .
docker run --rm -p 3001:3001 --env-file .env mcserverjars-api
```

### Indexers (cron/CI)

Project root: `mcserverjars.com/indexers/`

Indexers typically run on a schedule (cron or CI runner). They require:

- `SUPABASE_URL`
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- `OPENAI_API_KEY` (only for changelog generation)
- `API_URL` (optional; defaults to `https://api.mcserverjars.com`)

These map to `secrets.json` (`shared.supabase.*`, `shared.openai.*`, `projects.mcserverjars.indexers.*`).

